sequenceDiagram
    actor P as Petugas
    participant UI as Dashboard Admin
    participant C as ServiceRequestController
    participant D as DocumentGenerationService
    participant DB as Basis Data
    participant WA as Layanan WhatsApp
    P->>UI: Buka detail permohonan
    UI->>C: Minta data permohonan
    C->>DB: Ambil data dan berkas
    DB-->>UI: Tampilkan detail
    P->>UI: Verifikasi dan proses
    UI->>C: Perbarui status
    C->>DB: Simpan status dan histori
    P->>UI: Terbitkan dokumen
    UI->>C: Perintah publish
    C->>D: Generate dokumen final
    D->>DB: Simpan artefak dokumen
    C->>WA: Kirim notifikasi selesai
    C-->>UI: Status completed
